WEBVTT

00:06.800 --> 00:11.240
Protect Your Majesty protect Your Majesty Your Majesty Your Majesty.

00:12.760 --> 00:16.000
Your Majesty Your Majesty Your Majesty.

00:22.500 --> 00:32.500
In the twenty-sixth year of Longwu, the Xuan army annihilated Shi Lang's forces in the Battle of Tiannan Pass. Shi Lang himself met his end at Dama Mountain—a clash commemorated in history as the 'Battle of Tiannan Pass'.

00:35.280 --> 00:39.840
Quack doctors they're all quacks drag them all out and behead them General, spare us.

00:39.920 --> 00:43.920
General, please spare us Your Majesty's injury has reached the internal organs.

00:44.000 --> 00:48.120
Coupled with years of managing state affairs and recent continuous battles.

00:48.520 --> 00:51.640
Now Your Majesty's body is exhausted.

00:52.000 --> 00:54.960
We truly are powerless.

00:57.120 --> 00:58.520
Forget it.

01:00.640 --> 01:02.240
Don't trouble them.

01:03.280 --> 01:04.680
Your Majesty.

01:05.680 --> 01:08.200
Your Majesty find someone.

01:09.280 --> 01:10.960
Keep them under guard.

01:12.440 --> 01:14.280
No one may contact them.

01:15.560 --> 01:16.920
Yes.

01:17.000 --> 01:22.040
Also from now on without my permission.

01:23.800 --> 01:29.000
Anyone may not approach the tent within ten zhang.

01:32.640 --> 01:34.480
What if the two generals come to request an audience?

01:34.560 --> 01:35.920
You say.

01:37.000 --> 01:40.600
I am exhausted from marching.

01:42.040 --> 01:47.920
Everything will be discussed upon return to court now.

01:48.320 --> 01:49.987
The central plains are settled.

01:50.960 --> 01:52.440
Shilang is dead.

01:53.240 --> 01:54.640
Our dynasty.

01:56.040 --> 01:58.760
Has no more worries.

02:00.480 --> 02:02.040
Soldiers.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.920
Should go home.

02:08.600 --> 02:12.080
First month of the 27th year of Longwu you issue an edict.

02:12.160 --> 02:15.720
Ordering the Second Prince Sikong Xu to continue guarding Yan Bei.

02:15.800 --> 02:20.040
The rest of the army returns to court when reaching the Shuoyang County area.

02:20.120 --> 02:24.987
The weather became increasingly cold you had to rest temporarily in Yiyang City.

02:35.160 --> 02:39.827
Your Majesty the weather is too cold not suitable for long outings.

02:40.000 --> 02:41.400
Your health is important.

02:42.240 --> 02:43.640
Have they all arrived?

02:44.200 --> 02:45.600
Yes.

02:45.680 --> 02:51.560
The people you wish to summon are all in the city awaiting your order good.

02:51.640 --> 02:53.040
Good.

02:55.120 --> 02:59.280
At this time, the city lord's residence has been converted into your temporary residence.

03:00.120 --> 03:03.040
All your affairs are managed here.

03:04.160 --> 03:09.000
Years of warfare Your hair has actually shown some silver.

03:10.640 --> 03:15.520
Though physically weak Your eyes still shine with light.

03:17.760 --> 03:22.200
You know your time is running out but the newly pacified realm.

03:22.440 --> 03:25.440
Cannot fall into chaos again because of your departure.

03:25.640 --> 03:29.680
You must handle everything that follows.

03:38.720 --> 03:40.120
Your Majesty.

03:55.560 --> 03:56.960
Issue orders.

